From c87dc6d4a82d23a989f8b808683ce051118cdaca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:51:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 23/57] m3: draw constant colour layers

A layer with flag 0x400 and no texture draws its colour (stored b, g, r, a) times rgbMultiply, rest values, after WhiteoutFlakes M3LayerValue mode 2 and LayerTint. An all-zero colour and a multiply <= 0 read as unset. No channel select or team colour on such a layer.
---
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/layer.ts               | 64 ++++++++++++++++---
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/shaders/layers.glsl.ts | 35 +++++-----
 2 files changed, 74 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/viewer/handlers/m3/layer.ts b/src/viewer/handlers/m3/layer.ts
index a692e5ce..a907d527 100644
--- a/src/viewer/handlers/m3/layer.ts
